[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2727025114","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104198#issuecomment-2727025114","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104198","id":2727025114,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6iixna","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-15T22:15:08Z","updated_at":"2025-03-15T22:15:08Z","body":"> This is the \"obvious\" solution, but it has a lethal drawback: it makes skeleton animations look choppy, since armatures aren't affected by physics interpolation.\n\nThis could be addressed by interpolating skeleton transforms automatically: https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/10770","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2727025114/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2727235032","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104198#issuecomment-2727235032","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104198","id":2727235032,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ijk3Y","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-16T07:11:17Z","updated_at":"2025-03-16T17:00:55Z","body":"Should already be fixed by #103685, needs review.\nAll these classes of problem are the same, will write more when home.\n\nThe solution is probably to to set `physics_interpolation_mode` to OFF for the node that is being animated on idle. The snag is, as you have found that this node inherits non-interpolated physics xforms from the parent, because of the current server design.\n\nThis can likely be worked around with the script from here on the first physics interpolation OFF child:\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103025#issuecomment-2670873689\n\nUltimately the better solution for this class of problems is to move interpolation to the scene side in #103685, so that you automatically inherit interpolated xforms when a branch is set to OFF.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2727235032/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]